{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-kyverno-2026-122319","published":"2026-11-17T11:49:23.071Z","modified":"2026-11-17T13:41:12.227902294Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-122319","GHSA-r2p2-3892-5jjf"],"summary":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 Denial of Service via In/NotIn Operator Panic","details":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 contains a denial-of-service vulnerability in the In and NotIn operators that allows attackers to crash the policy engine via an unchecked type assertion. Attackers can submit resources whose JMESPath-evaluated values yield arrays of integers, booleans, or mixed types, triggering a panic that disrupts admission control and policy enforcement.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kyverno","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/kyverno"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.19.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/kyverno/BIT-kyverno-2026-122319.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/kyverno/kyverno/security/advisories/GHSA-r2p2-3892-5jjf"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-122319"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/kyverno-before-1.19.2-denial-of-service-via-in-notin-operator-panic"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:kyverno:kyverno:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}